{"id":"dfbbd3e4e75d12c7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dep-pred-11.md","title":"Set semantics","display":"df-dependent-predicate-set — Set semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dep-pred-11","aliases":["16-df-dep-pred-11","Set-indexed dependent predicate"],"display":"df-dependent-predicate-set — Set semantics","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-type]]"],"source":"§10.1 p.584 (PDF604); §11.2 p.654 (PDF674), powerset instance","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dep-pred-11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dep-pred-11</span><span>Set-indexed dependent predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-predicate-set — Set semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 p.584 (PDF604); §11.2 p.654 (PDF674), powerset instance"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (依赖类型, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"093bd17785f1dbfc\" href=\"?note=093bd17785f1dbfc\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type\">16-df-dependent-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.\\sigma\">\\(\\Gamma.\\sigma\\)</span> 是下节构造的总空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为任意集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\)</span> (本文件定义的依赖谓词集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma.\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}set} \\vdash P\\in\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}set} \\vdash P\\in\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>谓词以其真值纤维的子集表示，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 当作未定义集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-type","status":"resolved","id":"093bd17785f1dbfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)$ (依赖类型, see [[16-df-dependent-type]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_U(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,x)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land x\\in\\sigma(\\gamma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\;\\coloneqq\\;\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dependent\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}set} \\vdash P\\in\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false}],"bytes":1175,"backlinks":[{"id":"77011268b2b82ae6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原来的 $q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E$ 塔描述另一种结构，不能作为本书此处 DPL 的接口。参数 $\\chi$ 决定扩展语境，须显式保留。集合实例 $P\\subseteq\\Gamma.\\sigma$ 单独见 [[16-df-dep-pred-11]]。"},{"id":"6b0c62510422f352","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本页限于集合模型：$\\Gamma$ 为集合，$\\sigma:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族；$\\Gamma.\\sigma$、$\\mathsf{DepPred}(\\Gamma,\\sigma)=\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.\\sigma)$ 采用 [[16-df-dep-pred-11]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-pred-11|df-dependent-predicate-set — Set semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["093bd17785f1dbfc"]}